These files are not included in te public repository for security purpose, it should be added to run the application:

src/main/java/org/employdemy/library/lms/config/SecurityConfig.java
  -this is a java file including all the security configurations to be included in config folder.
src/main/java/org/employdemy/library/lms/security
  -this is a folder which consist of five java files CustomJwtEntryPoint, CustomUserDetails, CustomUserDetailsService, JwtAuthenticationFilter and JwtUtil
  -included for jwt token generation and authentication in application
src/main/resources/application.properties
  -this includes all the important connection details needs to be connected to database, and admin email.

